; safe-off: tell the user whether every disk is written out (plan 2026-10-29-amarchy-p4-capture-notify-power.md R4.12).
; Reboot DRYRUN flushes every volume and names each answer without restarting: rc 0 all answered, 5 one did not.
Reboot DRYRUN >T:safeoff.txt
If WARN
  amnotify "Not all disks answered" BODYFILE T:safeoff.txt SECONDS 0
Else
  amnotify "Safe to switch off" SECONDS 0
EndIf
